              and a darker point of view.
            </p>
            <div class="hero__actions">
              <a class="button" href="#featured-products">Shop featured products</a>
              <a class="button--secondary" href="#editorial-content">Read the journal</a>
            </div>
            <ul class="pill-list" aria-label="Popular categories">
